s pain......"}, "480217": {"char_code": "AUG", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "Commander, you will not have the chance for remorse for many situations out there if you act too rashly."}, "480218": {"char_code": "AUG", "voice_key": "FORMATION", "caption": "Being together with everyone is my honour."}, "480219": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "480220": {"char_code": "AUG", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Well then......It's time to move out."}}}